{"unit_id":"tag:0FFJ:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是范畴（category）。假设给定函子（functor）<MATH_0002>。我们常想知道<MATH_0003>是否满足结合的（associative）法则，以及<MATH_0004>是否有单位元（unit）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003><MATH_0005>的一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>结合约束（associativity constraint）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是一个函子性的（functorial）同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0006>，使得对所有对象（objects）<MATH_0007>，图表（diagram）<MATH_0008>都是交换的（commutative）；其中每个箭头（arrow）都由适当应用<MATH_0009>以及<MATH_0010>的函子性（functoriality）确定。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005><REF_0001>解释了上述三元组<MATH_0011>如何是相干的（coherent）。一种重新表述是，这样的三元组产生一个良定义的函子（functors）系统（system）<MATH_0012>，对所有<MATH_0013>均如此；并对<MATH_0014>产生函子性同构（functorial isomorphisms）<MATH_0015>，使得由这些同构（isomorphisms）组成的一切可能图表（diagrams）都交换（commute）（上面的五边形图表（diagram）就是一例）。对<MATH_0016>，这意味着表达式<MATH_0017>都函子性地同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0018>，并且这些同构（isomorphisms）与在三个连续位置上使用<MATH_0019>（在可能时）所得到的这些函子（functors）之间的一切可能同构（isomorphisms）都相容。下文将使用这一点而不再提及；写<MATH_0020>的迭代时，我们也不再写括号。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>上述三元组<MATH_0021>的一个<TEXTITOPEN_0002>单位元（unit）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>是一个对象（object）<MATH_0022>，它属于<MATH_0023>，并带有函子性同构（functorial isomorphisms）\n<MATHSEG_0001>和<MATHSEG_0002>\n使得对所有对象（objects）<MATH_0024>，图表（diagram）<MATH_0025>都是交换的（commutative）。我们常将单位元（units）视为二元组<MATH_0026>，如下一个引理所述。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"associative","target_term":"结合的"},{"source_term":"unit","target_term":"单位元"},{"source_term":"associativity constraint","target_term":"结合约束"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性的"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换的"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"functoriality","target_term":"函子性"},{"source_term":"coherent","target_term":"相干的"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"